# .dockerignore：凭证、日志、参考源码、缓存与构建产物一律不进镜像层。
.env.local
.env.*
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
**/*.key
**/*.pem
deploy/.env
# 参考代码/、重构指南/ 等中文根目录；旧版 BuildKit 的排除模式头只接受 ASCII。
[^a-zA-Z0-9._]*/
logs/
.git/
.runtime/
node_modules/
web/node_modules/
form-runtime/node_modules/
web/dist/
**/node_modules/
**/.git/
executor-service/dist/
executor-service/page/dist/
executor-service/flow-source/dist/
executor-service/flow-source/.env*
executor-service/flow-source/.npmrc
executor-service/flow-source/.claude/
executor-service/flow-source/.omc/
.tmp/
runtime/
bin/
server
server.exe
coverage.out
test/
docs/
*.log
